5\">技能详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"技能 骑士•无畏向前！.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/3/3a/n1rq32etg57d9ea7333qt2u8y3ycn5r.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E9%AA%91%E5%A3%AB%E2%80%A2%E6%97%A0%E7%95%8F%E5%90%91%E5%89%8D%EF%BC%81.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/3/3a/n1rq32etg57d9ea7333qt2u8y3ycn5r.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E9%AA%91%E5%A3%AB%E2%80%A2%E6%97%A0%E7%95%8F%E5%90%91%E5%89%8D%EF%BC%81.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/3/3a/n1rq32etg57d9ea7333qt2u8y3ycn5r.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />骑士•无畏向前！\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>1\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>2\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>近战、对地面\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>1-3十字\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓1-↑1\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>3X3\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓2-↑2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（物理攻击）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"瞬发\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">瞬发</font></span></span>]，选择自身十字范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>圈内任一地形格，进行[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"冲锋\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">冲锋</font></span></span>]，对目标范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>圈内最近<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>名敌人造成自身<font color=\"#ed7950\">25%</font>生命值的单体伤害，并施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"胆寒\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">胆寒</font></span></span>]，持续2回合。<br />✦攻击后，自身获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"满满安全感护盾\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">满满安全感护盾</font></span></span>]，持续2回合。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 1-3十字 3X3.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/4/4f/6h8odcfud1jc5gdh2hakk3jnl1m7oi1.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-3%E5%8D%81%E5%AD%97_3X3.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/4/4f/6h8odcfud1jc5gdh2hakk3jnl1m7oi1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"90\" data-file-height=\"90\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%85%8B%E6%8B%89%E6%8B%89\" title=\"角色图鉴库/克拉拉\"><img alt=\"头像 克拉拉.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/1/1b/he10i3yxupczk82a0dnmgnkcfe0rtzn.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">克拉拉</font></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门内</b>\n</th>\